      ],
      "estleg:versionOf": {
        "@id": "estleg:Reg_160872_Par_17"
      },
      "estleg:versionValidFrom": {
        "@value": "2003-05-06",
        "@type": "xsd:date"
      },
      "estleg:versionText": "Taotleja, tema eelnenud majandustegevuse, kavandatava investeeringu ja sellele järgneva majandustegevuse vastavus maapiirkonna infrastruktuuri investeeringutoetuse saamiseks esitatud nõuetele tehakse kindlaks ja hindamisleht koostatakse vastavalt §-le 6. <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"width: 100.0%\" width=\"100%\"> <tbody><tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; width: 39.0%; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\" width=\"39%\"> <p align=\"right\"> Vabariigi Valitsuse 3. juuli 2001. a määruse nr 219 «Eesti Vabariigis põllumajanduse ja maaelu arendamise liitumiseelse programmi raames antava investeeringutoetuse taotluse hindamise kord»<br/>lisa 1<br/>(Vabariigi Valitsuse 21. jaanuari 2003. a määruse nr 19 sõnastuses) </p> <p align=\"right\" style=\"line-height: 12.75pt\"> [<a href=\"./242656\">RT I 2003, 11, 51</a> - jõust. 1. 03. 2003] </p> <p align=\"center\"> </p> </td> </tr> </tbody></table> PÕLLUMAJANDUSTOOTMISE INVESTEERINGUTOETUSE SAAMISEKS ESITATUD NÕUETELE VASTAVUSE HINDAMISEKS VÕRRELDAVAD ANDMED <table class=\"data\" style=\"width: 450.0pt\"> <tbody><tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p align=\"center\"> <b>A</b> </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p align=\"center\"> <b>B</b> </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p align=\"center\"> <b>C</b> </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p align=\"center\"> <b>D</b> </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p align=\"center\"> <b>E</b> </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\"> <p> </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p align=\"center\"> Põllumajandustootmise investeeringutoetuse saamiseks esitatud nõue </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p align=\"center\"> Jrk nr </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p align=\"center\"> Toetuse taotlemiseks esitatud dokument¹ </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p align=\"center\"> Toetuse taotlemiseks esitatud dokument¹ </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"5\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 1. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"5\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Äriregistrikood või füüsilisest isikust ettevõtja puhul, kes ei ole äriregistrisse kantud, maksukohustuslaste registri tõendi number või isikukood </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 1.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Maksukohustuslaste registri tõendi koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 1.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kinnitatud majandusaasta aruande koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 1.3 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Maksuameti tõend </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 1.4 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Aktsionäride või osanike nimekiri </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 1.5 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Veterinaar- ja Toiduameti hinnang </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"3\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"3\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 1.6 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Keskkonnamemorandum või selle koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 1.7 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Seadusejärgset esindusõigust mitteomava isiku puhul volitusi tõendav volikiri </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 1.8 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 3 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 2. </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatav investeeringuobjekt asub maapiirkonnas </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 2.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 3 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 3. </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Taotleja poolt toodetud põllumajandussaaduste müügitulu taotlemisele eelnenud majandusaastal oli vähemalt 50 protsenti realiseerimise netokäibest või laekumistest majandustegevuse tulemusena, millest on maha arvatud laekumised põhivara müügist ja riiklikest toetustest </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 3.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 3 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 4. </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Eelnenud majandusaasta realiseeritud piima osakaal moodustab vähemalt 70 protsenti piima tootmise kogumahust, kui taotleja taotleb investeeringutoetust piimatootmise arendamiseks ja seakasvatusega ei tegele </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 4.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 3 tabel 3 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 3 tabel 7 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 5. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Eelnenud majandusaasta teravilja, rapsi, rüpsi ja kartuli realiseerimise osakaal moodustab vähemalt 70 protsenti vastava põllumajandussaaduse tootmise kogumahust või madalama osakaalu puhul on nimetatud toodang arvestatud eelnenud majandusaasta lõppbilansis varudesse, kui taotleja taotleb investeeringutoetust taimekasvatuse arendamiseks ja loomakasvatusega ei tegele </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 5.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 3 tabel 3 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 3 tabel 7 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 5.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 3 tabel 3 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 3 tabel 5 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 6. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Eelnenud majandusaasta puuviljade ja marjade realiseerimise osakaal moodustab vähemalt 70 protsenti vastava põllumajandussaaduse tootmise kogumahust või madalama osakaalu puhul on nimetatud toodang arvestatud eelnenud majandusaasta lõppbilansis varudesse, kui taotleja taotleb toetust põllumajandustootmise mitmekesistamiseks </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 6.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 3 tabel 3 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 3 tabel 7 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 6.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 3 tabel 3 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 3 tabel 5 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 7. </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Äriühingu osa- või aktsiakapitalis riigi, kohaliku omavalitsusüksuse või avalik-õigusliku juriidilise isiku osalus koos või eraldi ei ületa 25 protsenti </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 7.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Aktsionäride või osanike nimekiri </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 8. </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Mitte varasema kui taotluse esitamisele eelnenud kuu esimese päeva seisuga on täidetud maksuseadustes sätestatud kohustused ja riikliku maksu maksuvõlga ei ole või maksuvõla tasumise ajatamise korral on maksud tasutud ajakava kohaselt </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 8.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Maksuameti tõend </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 9. </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatav investeeringuobjekt vastab investeeringujärgselt Euroopa Liidu veterinaar- ja hügieeninõuetele </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 9.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Veterinaar- ja Toiduameti hinnang </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 10. </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringuobjekti kohta on kolme pakkuja hinnapakkumised, juhul kui investeeringuobjekti maksumus ületab 10 000 eurot </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 10.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Hinnavõrdlustabel, kui investeeringuobjekti maksumus ületab 10 000 eurot </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"3\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 11. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"3\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatav investeeringuobjekt ostetakse kapitalirendi korras </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 11.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kapitalirendilepingu projekt </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 11.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kapitalirendi maksegraafiku projekt </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 11.3 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 3 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 12. </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Pika- ja lühiajalised kohustused </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 12.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 3 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kinnitatud majandusaasta aruande koopia või füüsilisest isikust ettevõtja bilansi koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 13. </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Omakapital </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 13.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 3 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kinnitatud majandusaasta aruande koopia või füüsilisest isikust ettevõtja bilansi koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 14. </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kasum </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 14.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 3 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kinnitatud majandusaasta aruande koopia või füüsilisest isikust ettevõtja kasumiaruande koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 15. </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Tulude ja kulude vahe </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 15.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 3 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Tulude ja kulude koond füüsilisest isikust ettevõtja puhul, kes vastavalt «Raamatupidamise seadusele» peab kassapõhist raamatupidamisarvestust </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 16. </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Pikaajalised kohustused </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 16.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 3 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Pikaajaliste kohustuste maksegraafiku koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 17. </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Ehitiste, masinate, seadmete, tööriistade, sisseseade ja muu inventari soetusmaksumus </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 17.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 3 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Ehitiste, masinate, seadmete, tööriistade, sisseseade ja muu inventari loetelu </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"4\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 18. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"4\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatav investeeringuobjekt </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 18.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parimale hinnapakkumisele vastav pakkumiskutse koopia koos pakkumise tehniliste tingimuste loeteluga </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 18.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 18.3 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 3 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 18.4 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Hinnavõrdlustabel, kui investeeringuobjekti maksumus ületab 10 000 eurot </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 19. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatav investeering vastab tegevusalale, mille arendamiseks investeeringutoetust taotletakse </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 19.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 19.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 3 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 20. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringuobjekti tehnilised tingimused </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 20.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parimale hinnapakkumisele vastav pakkumiskutse koopia koos pakkumise tehniliste tingimuste loeteluga </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 20.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"3\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 21. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"3\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringuobjekti maksumus </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 21.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 21.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 3 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 21.3 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Hinnavõrdlustabel, kui investeeringuobjekti maksumus ületab 10 000 eurot </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 22. </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringu tegemise majandusaasta kohustused ja omakapital kokku on suurem kavandatava investeeringuobjekti maksumusest </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 22.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 3 tabel 5 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 3 tabel 11 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 23. </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringu tegemise majandusaasta kavandatavaks investeeringuks kasutatavate oma- ja laenuvahendite ning toetatava investeeringu maksumuse vahe või juhul, kui kavandatav investeering tehakse mitmel majandusaastal, siis nimetatud majandusaastate kavandatavaks investeeringuks kasutatavate oma- ja laenuvahendite ning toetatava investeeringu maksumuse vahe absoluutväärtus on suurem või võrdne taotletava toetuse suurusega </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 23.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 3 tabel 9 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 3 tabel 11 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 24. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Puuvilja- ja marjakultuuride paljundusmaterjali maksimaalne toetatav ühikute arv hektari kohta vastab programmi lisa 6 esimese meetme punktis 11 ettenähtud nõuetele </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 24.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 24.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 3 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 25. </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Puuvilja- ja marjakultuuride paljundusmaterjali maksimaalne toetatav ühiku hind vastab programmi lisa 6 esimese meetme punktis 11 ettenähtud nõuetele </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 25.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 3 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 26. </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringu maksumusest taotletava toetuse osa suurus vastab programmi lisa 6 esimese meetme punktis 11 ettenähtud nõuetele </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 26.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 3 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 27. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringuobjekti maksumusse ei ole arvestatud kulusid maa ja olemasolevate ehitiste ostmiseks ning rentimiseks, sh kasutus- ja kapitalirendi korras ostmiseks </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 27.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 27.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 3 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 28. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringuobjekti maksumusse ei ole arvestatud kulusid tolli-, sisseveo-, käibe- ja muude maksete tasumiseks, mida hüvitatakse, kompenseeritakse, tasaarveldatakse ja kustutatakse ning mis ei moodusta osa Eesti üldisest maksusüsteemist </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 28.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 28.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 3 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 29. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringu maksumusse ei ole arvestatud kulusid taotleja enda või tema töötajate poolt tehtud tööde eest tasumiseks </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 29.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 29.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 3 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 30. </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringuobjekti maksumusse ei ole arvestatud kulusid kasutatud seadmete ostmiseks </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 30.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 31. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringu maksumusse ei ole arvestatud kulusid taotleja tegevuskuludeks, sh remondi- ja rendikuludeks, kütuse-, palga-, koolitus-, side- ja transpordikuludeks </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 31.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 31.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 3 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 32. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringuobjekti maksumusse ei ole arvestatud kulusid kasutus- ja kapitalirendi tasumiseks, kui rendilepingu alusel renditud vara omandiõigus ei lähe üle taotlejale </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 32.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 32.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kapitalirendilepingu projekt </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 33. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringu maksumusse ei ole arvestatud kulusid panga teenustasudeks ja tagatismakseteks </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 33.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 33.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 3 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 34. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringu maksumusse ei ole arvestatud kulusid konverteerimiskuludeks ja SAPARD-eurokonto kasutamisest tulenevate kursimuutuste kahjumite katmiseks </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 34.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 34.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 3 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 35. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringu maksumusse ei ole arvestatud kulusid avaliku sektori halduskulude, kaasa arvatud Ameti poolt tehtavate kulutuste, sealhulgas järelevalve ja kontrolli teostamise eest vastutavate ametnike töötasude, rendi-, üld- ning juhtimiskulude eest tasumiseks </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 35.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 35.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 3 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 36. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringu maksumusse ei ole arvestatud kulusid juriidilisteks konsultatsioonideks, raamatupidamisteenuste eest tasumiseks, patentide ja litsentside ostmiseks ning teostatavusuuringuteks, v.a ehitise projekteerimiseks vajalike ehitusgeoloogilisteks ja -geodeetilisteks uurimistöödeks tehtud kulutuste eest tasumiseks </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 36.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 36.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 3 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 37. </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringu maksumusse ei ole arvestatud kulusid väljastpoolt Euroopa Liidu liikmes- või kandidaatriike pärinevate tellitavate tööde, teenuste ja ostetavate kaupade eest tasumiseks </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 37.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 38. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringu maksumusse ei ole arvestatud kulusid projekti teostajatele või selles osalejatele enne projekti lõpuleviimist rahalisi laekumisi võimaldavate tööde, teenuste ja kaupade eest tasumiseks </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 38.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 38.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 3 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 39. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringu maksumusse ei ole arvestatud kulusid reklaami eest tasumiseks </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 39.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 39.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 3 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 40. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringuobjekti maksumusse ei ole arvestatud kulusid investeeringuobjekti ehitamiseks, rekonstrueerimiseks ja ostmiseks, mille kasutusotstarve on jaekaubanduslike teenuste osutamine </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 40.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 40.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 3 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"3\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 41. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"3\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringuobjekti maksumusse ei ole arvestatud enne taotluse esitamist tehtud kulusid investeeringuobjekti ehitamiseks, rekonstrueerimiseks ja ostmiseks, v.a investeeringuobjekti ehitusprojekti ettevalmistamiseks tellitud töödele ja teenustele ning projekteerimiseks vajalikele ehitusgeoloogilistele ja -geodeetilistele uurimistöödele tehtud kulutused </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 41.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 41.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Ehitiste, masinate, seadmete, tööriistade, sisseseade ja muu inventari loetelu eelnenud majandusaasta viimase päeva seisuga </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 41.3 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 3 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 42. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringuobjekti maksumusse ei ole arvestatud kulusid masinate ja seadmete lisaseadmete ostmiseks, mille olemasolu ei ole vajalik kavandatava investeeringu eesmärgi saavutamiseks </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 42.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 42.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 3 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 43. </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatud mittetoetatavate investeeringute kajastamine </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 43.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 3 tabel 9 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 3 tabel 11 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 44. </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Toetatava investeeringu maksumusse ei ole arvestatud investeeringuobjektiga seotud projekteerimistööd ja projekteerimiseks vajalikku ehitusgeoloogilist ja -geodeetilist uurimistööd ning investeeringutoetuse taotluse ja äriprojekti ning neis esitatud andmeid tõendavate dokumentide koostamiseks tellitud tööd ja teenust, mis ületab 12% investeeringuobjekti käibemaksuta maksumusest </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 44.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 3 </p> </td> </tr> </tbody></table> 1Veerus toodud lisad on Vabariigi Valitsuse 28. juuni 2001. a määruse nr 216 «Eesti Vabariigis põllumajanduse ja maaelu arendamise liitumiseelse programmi raames antava investeeringutoetuse taotlemise, taotluse menetlemise ja toetuse maksmise kord» (RT I 2001, 60, 363; 2002, 6, 25) lisad. <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"width: 100.0%\" width=\"100%\"> <tbody><tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; width: 99.46%; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\" width=\"99%\"> <p align=\"right\"> Vabariigi Valitsuse 3. juuli 2001. a määruse nr 219 «Eesti Vabariigis põllumajanduse ja maaelu arendamise liitumiseelse programmi raames antava investeeringutoetuse taotluse hindamise kord»<br/>lisa 2<br/>(Vabariigi Valitsuse 21. jaanuari 2003. a määruse nr 19 sõnastuses) </p> </td> </tr> </tbody></table> RT I 2003 11 51 242656 2003-03-01+02:00 PÕLLUMAJANDUS- JA KALANDUSTOODETE TOOTMISE JA TURUSTAMISE PARANDAMISE INVESTEERINGUTOETUSE SAAMISEKS ESITATUD NÕUETELE VASTAVUSE HINDAMISEKS VÕRRELDAVAD ANDMED <table class=\"data\" style=\"width: 450.0pt\"> <tbody><tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p align=\"center\"> <b>A</b> </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p align=\"center\"> <b>B</b> </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p align=\"center\"> <b>C</b> </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p align=\"center\"> <b>D</b> </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p align=\"center\"> <b>E</b> </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\"> <p> </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p align=\"center\"> Põllumajandus- ja kalandustoodete tootmise ja turustamise parandamise investeeringutoetuse saamiseks esitatud nõue </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p align=\"center\"> Jrk nr </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p align=\"center\"> Toetuse taotlemiseks esitatud dokument¹ </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p align=\"center\"> Toetuse taotlemiseks esitatud dokument¹ </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"7\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 1. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"7\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Äriregistrikood </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 1.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 6 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kinnitatud majandusaasta aruannete koopiad </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 1.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 6 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Maksuameti tõend </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 1.3 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 6 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Aktsionäride või osanike nimekiri </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 1.4 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 6 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Veterinaar- ja Toiduameti hinnang </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 1.5 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 6 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Keskkonnamemorandum või selle koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 1.6 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 6 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Seadusejärgset esindusõigust mitteomava isiku puhul volitusi tõendav volikiri </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 1.7 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 6 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 7 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 2. </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatav investeeringuobjekt asub Eesti Vabariigi territooriumil </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 2.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 6 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 7 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 3. </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Äriühingus töötas taotlemisele eelnenud kuu viimase tööpäeva seisuga vähemalt 10 täistööajaga töötajat </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 3.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 6 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 7 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 4. </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Äriühingu osa- või aktsiakapitalis riigi, kohaliku omavalitsusüksuse või avalik-õigusliku juriidilise isiku osalus koos või eraldi ei ületa 25 protsenti </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 4.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 6 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Aktsionäride või osanike nimekiri </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 5. </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Mitte varasema kui taotluse esitamisele eelnenud kuu esimese päeva seisuga on täidetud maksuseadustes sätestatud kohustused ja riikliku maksu maksuvõlga ei ole </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 5.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 6 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Maksuameti tõend </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 6. </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatav investeeringuobjekt vastab investeeringujärgselt Euroopa Liidu veterinaar- ja hügieeninõuetele </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 6.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 6 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Veterinaar- ja Toiduameti hinnang </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 7. </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatav investeeringuobjekt vastab investeeringujärgselt keskkonnakaitsenõuetele </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 7.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 6 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Keskkonnamemorandum või selle koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 8. </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringuobjekti kohta on kolme pakkuja hinnapakkumised, juhul kui investeeringuobjekti maksumus ületab 10 000 eurot </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 8.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 6 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Hinnavõrdlustabel, kui investeeringuobjekti maksumus ületab 10 000 eurot </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"3\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 9. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"3\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatav investeeringuobjekt ostetakse kapitalirendi korras </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 9.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 6 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kapitalirendilepingu projekt </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 9.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 6 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kapitalirendi maksegraafiku projekt </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 9.3 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 6 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 7 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 10. </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Pika- ja lühiajalised kohustused </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 10.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 7 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kinnitatud majandusaasta aruannete koopiad </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 11. </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Omakapital </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 11.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 7 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kinnitatud majandusaasta aruannete koopiad </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 12. </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kasum </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 12.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 7 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kinnitatud majandusaasta aruannete koopiad </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 13. </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Pikaajalised kohustused </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 13.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 7 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Pikaajaliste kohustuste maksegraafiku koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"4\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-b