 .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Hinnavõrdlustabel, kui investeeringuobjekti maksumus ületab 10 000 eurot </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 15. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatav investeering vastab tegevusalale, mille arendamiseks investeeringutoetust taotletakse </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 15.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 6 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 15.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 6 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 7 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 16. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringuobjekti tehnilised tingimused </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 16.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 6 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parimale hinnapakkumisele vastava pakkumiskutse koopia koos pakkumise tehniliste tingimuste loeteluga </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 16.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 6 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"3\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 17. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"3\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringuobjekti maksumus </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 17.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 6 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 17.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 6 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 7 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 17.3 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 6 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Hinnavõrdlustabel, kui investeeringuobjekti maksumus ületab 10 000 eurot </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 18. </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringu tegemise majandusaasta kavandatavaks investeeringuks kasutatavate oma- ja laenuvahendite ning toetatava investeeringu maksumuse vahe või juhul, kui kavandatav investeering tehakse mitmel majandusaastal, siis nimetatud majandusaastate kavandatavaks investeeringuks kasutatavate oma- ja laenuvahendite ning toetatava investeeringu maksumuse vahe absoluutväärtus on suurem või võrdne taotletava toetuse suurusega </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 18.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 7 tabel 8 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 7 tabel 10 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 19. </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringuobjekti maksumusest taotletava toetuse osa suurus vastab programmi lisa 6 teise meetme punktis 11 ettenähtud nõuetele </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 19.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 6 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 7 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 20. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringuobjekti maksumusse ei ole arvestatud kulusid maa ja olemasolevate ehitiste ostmiseks ning rentimiseks, sh kasutus- ja kapitalirendi korras ostmiseks </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 20.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 6 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 20.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 6 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 7 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 21. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringuobjekti maksumusse ei ole arvestatud kulusid tolli-, sisseveo-, käibe- ja muude maksete tasumiseks, mida hüvitatakse, kompenseeritakse, tasaarveldatakse ja kustutatakse ning mis ei moodusta osa Eesti üldisest maksusüsteemist </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 21.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 6 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 21.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 6 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 7 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 22. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringu maksumusse ei ole arvestatud kulusid taotleja enda või tema töötajate poolt tehtud tööde eest tasumiseks </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 22.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 6 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 22.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 6 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 7 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 23. </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringuobjekti maksumusse ei ole arvestatud kulusid kasutatud seadmete ostmiseks </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 23.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 6 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 24. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringu maksumusse ei ole arvestatud kulusid taotleja tegevuskuludeks, sh remondi- ja rendikuludeks, kütuse-, palga-, koolitus-, side- ja transpordikuludeks </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 24.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 6 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 24.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 6 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 7 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 25. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringuobjekti maksumusse ei ole arvestatud kulusid kasutus- ja kapitalirendi tasumiseks, kui rendilepingu alusel renditud vara omandiõigus ei lähe üle taotlejale </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 25.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 6 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 25.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 6 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kapitalirendilepingu projekt </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 26. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringu maksumusse ei ole arvestatud kulusid panga teenustasudeks ja tagatismakseteks </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 26.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 6 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 26.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 6 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 7 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 27. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringu maksumusse ei ole arvestatud kulusid konverteerimiskuludeks ja SAPARD-eurokonto kasutamisest tulenevate kursimuutuste kahjumite katmiseks </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 27.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 6 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 27.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 6 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 6 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 28. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringu maksumusse ei ole arvestatud kulusid avaliku sektori halduskulude, kaasa arvatud Ameti poolt tehtavate kulutuste, sealhulgas järelevalve ja kontrolli teostamise eest vastutavate ametnike töötasude, rendi-, üld- ning juhtimiskulude eest tasumiseks </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 28.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 6 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 28.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 6 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 7 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 29. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringu maksumusse ei ole arvestatud kulusid juriidilisteks konsultatsioonideks, raamatupidamisteenuste eest tasumiseks, patentide ja litsentside ostmiseks ning teostatavusuuringuteks, v.a ehitise projekteerimiseks vajalike ehitusgeoloogilisteks ja -geodeetilisteks uurimistöödeks tehtud kulutuste eest tasumiseks </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 29.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 6 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 29.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 6 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 7 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 30. </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringu maksumusse ei ole arvestatud kulusid väljastpoolt Euroopa Liidu liikmes- või kandidaatriike pärinevate tellitavate tööde, teenuste ja ostetavate kaupade eest tasumiseks </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 30.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 6 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 31. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringu maksumusse ei ole arvestatud kulusid projekti teostajatele või selles osalejatele enne projekti lõpuleviimist rahalisi laekumisi võimaldavate tööde, teenuste ja kaupade eest tasumiseks </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 31.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 6 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 31.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 6 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 7 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 32. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringu maksumusse ei ole arvestatud kulusid reklaami eest tasumiseks </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 32.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 6 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 32.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 6 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 7 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 33. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringuobjekti maksumusse ei ole arvestatud kulusid investeeringuobjekti ehitamiseks, rekonstrueerimiseks ja ostmiseks, mille kasutusotstarve on jaekaubanduslike teenuste osutamine </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 33.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 6 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 33.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 6 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 7 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 34. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringuobjekti maksumusse ei ole arvestatud enne taotluse esitamist tehtud kulusid investeeringuobjekti ehitamiseks, rekonstrueerimiseks ja ostmiseks, v.a investeeringuobjekti ehitusprojekti ettevalmistamiseks tellitud töödele ja teenustele ning projekteerimiseks vajalikele ehitusgeoloogilistele ja -geodeetilistele uurimistöödele tehtud kulutused </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 34.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 6 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 34.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 6 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 7 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 35. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringuobjekti maksumusse ei ole arvestatud kulusid masinate ja seadmete lisaseadmete ostmiseks, mille olemasolu ei ole vajalik kavandatava investeeringu eesmärgi saavutamiseks </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 35.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 6 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 35.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 6 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 7 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 36. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringuobjekti maksumusse ei ole arvestatud kulusid investeeringuobjekti ehitamiseks, rekonstrueerimiseks ja ostmiseks, mille kasutusse võtmisega suureneb taotleja olemasolev tootmisvõimsus või ja piimapulbri tootmiseks </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 36.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 6 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 36.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 6 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 7 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 37. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringuobjekti maksumusse ei ole arvestatud kulusid investeeringuobjekti ehitamiseks, rekonstrueerimiseks ja ostmiseks, mida kasutatakse kala- ja akvakultuuride tootmiseks (mitte inimtarbeks), v.a tekkivate tootmisjääkide töötlemiseks ja turustamiseks </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 37.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 6 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 37.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 6 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 7 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 38. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringuobjekti maksumusse ei ole arvestatud kulusid investeeringuobjekti ehitamiseks, rekonstrueerimiseks ja ostmiseks, mida kasutatakse kalalaevadel kala esmatöötlemiseks (kalade rookimine, peade eemaldamine, jahutamine ja külmutamine) </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 38.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 6 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 38.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 6 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 7 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 39. </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatud mittetoetatavate investeeringute kajastamine </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 39.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 7 tabel 8 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 7 tabel 10 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 40. </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Toetatava investeeringu maksumusse ei ole arvestatud investeeringuobjektiga seotud projekteerimistööd ja projekteerimiseks vajalikku ehitusgeoloogilist ja -geodeetilist uurimistööd ning investeeringutoetuse taotluse ja äriprojekti ning neis esitatud andmeid tõendavate dokumentide koostamiseks tellitud tööd ja teenust, mis ületab 12% investeeringuobjekti käibemaksuta maksumusest </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 40.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 6 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 7 </p> </td> </tr> </tbody></table> 1Veerus toodud lisad on Vabariigi Valitsuse 28. juuni 2001. a määruse nr 216 «Eesti Vabariigis põllumajanduse ja maaelu arendamise liitumiseelse programmi raames antava investeeringutoetuse taotlemise, taotluse menetlemise ja toetuse maksmise kord» lisad. Vabariigi Valitsuse 3. juuli 2001. a määruse nr 219 «Eesti Vabariigis põllumajanduse ja maaelu arendamise liitumiseelse programmi raames antava investeeringutoetuse taotluse hindamise kord» lisa 3 RT I 2003 11 51 242656 2003-03-01+02:00 PÕLLUMAJANDUS- JA KALANDUSTOODETE TOOTMISE JA TURUSTAMISE PARANDAMISE INVESTEERINGUTOETUSE PAREMUSJÄRJESTUSE MÄÄRAMISEKS VÕRRELDAVAD ANDMED <table class=\"data\" style=\"width: 100.0%\"> <tbody><tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\"> <p align=\"center\"> Põllumajandus- ja kalandustoodete tootmise ja turustamise parandamise investeeringutoetuse paremusjärjestuse määramiseks esitatud nõue </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\"> <p align=\"center\"> Toetuse taotlemiseks esitatud dokument </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\"> <p align=\"center\"> Toetuse taotlemiseks esitatud dokument </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"3\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 1. Uue tootmishoone ehitamine </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 6¹ </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 6 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Ehitise tehnilise projekti koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 6 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 7 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"3\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 2. Olemasoleva tootmishoone täielik rekonstrueerimine </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 6 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 6 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Ehitise tehnilise projekti koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 6 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 7 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"3\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 3. Olemasoleva tootmishoone osaline rekonstrueerimine </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 6 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 6 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Ehitise tehnilise projekti koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 6 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 7 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 4. Tootmistehnoloogiliste seadmete ostmine tootearenduseks </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 6 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 6 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 7 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 5. Puhastus- või pesemissüsteemi, õhu saastet vähendava keskküttesüsteemi, jäätmekäitluse või keskkonnasõbraliku külmutustehnika seadmete ostmine keskkonnanõuete täitmise parandamiseks </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 6 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 6 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 7 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 6. Investeeringu käigus lõpetatakse põllumajandus- ja kalandustoodete tootmine taotlejale kuuluvas vähemalt ühes eraldiseisvas tootmisüksuses või tütar- või sidusettevõttes </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 6 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 7 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 7. Taotletava toetuse osa suurus kavandatava investeeringu maksumusest </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 6 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 7 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 8. Taotleja on sõlminud lepingud tooraine kohta põllumajandustootjaga või ettevõtjaga, kes on sõlminud lepingud tootjaga </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 6 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 7 </p> </td> </tr> </tbody></table> 1Vabariigi Valitsuse 28. juuni 2001. a määruse nr 216 «Eesti Vabariigi põllumajanduse ja maaelu arendamise liitumiseelse programmi raames antava investeeringutoetuse taotlemise, taotluse menetlemise ja toetuse maksmise kord» lisa. <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"width: 100.0%\" width=\"100%\"> <tbody><tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; width: 99.46%; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\" width=\"99%\"> <p align=\"right\"> Vabariigi Valitsuse 3. juuli 2001. a määruse nr 219 «Eesti Vabariigis põllumajanduse ja maaelu arendamise liitumiseelse programmi raames antava investeeringutoetuse taotluse hindamise kord»<br/>lisa 4<br/>(Vabariigi Valitsuse 21. jaanuari 2003. a määruse nr 19 sõnastuses) </p> </td> </tr> </tbody></table> RT I 2003 11 51 242656 2003-03-01+02:00 MAAPIIRKONNAS ALTERNATIIVSE MAJANDUSTEGEVUSE ARENDAMISE JA MITMEKESISTAMISE INVESTEERINGUTOETUSE SAAMISEKS ESITATUD NÕUETELE VASTAVUSE HINDAMISEKS VÕRRELDAVAD ANDMED <table class=\"data\" style=\"width: 450.0pt\"> <tbody><tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p align=\"center\"> <b>A</b> </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p align=\"center\"> <b>B</b> </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p align=\"center\"> <b>C</b> </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p align=\"center\"> <b>D</b> </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p align=\"center\"> <b>E</b> </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\"> <p> </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p align=\"center\"> Maapiirkonnas alternatiivse majandustegevuse arendamise ja mitmekesistamise investeeringutoetuse saamiseks esitatud nõue </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p align=\"center\"> Jrk nr </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p align=\"center\"> Toetuse taotlemiseks esitatud dokument¹ </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p align=\"center\"> Toetuse taotlemiseks esitatud dokument¹ </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"8\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 1. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"8\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Äriregistrikood või füüsilisest isikust ettevõtja puhul, kes ei ole äriregistrisse kantud, maksukohustuslaste registri tõendi number või isikukood </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 1.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 8 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Maksukohustuslaste registri tõendi koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 1.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 8 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kinnitatud majandusaasta aruande koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 1.3 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 8 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Maksuameti tõend </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 1.4 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 8 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Aktsionäride või osanike nimekiri </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 1.5 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 8 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Veterinaar- ja Toiduameti hinnang </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 1.6 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 8 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Keskkonnamemorandum või selle koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 1.7 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 8 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Seadusejärgset esindusõigust mitteomava isiku puhul volitusi tõendav volikiri </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 1.8 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 8 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 9 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 2. </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatav investeeringuobjekt asub maapiirkonnas </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 2.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 8 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 9 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 3. </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Äriühingu osa- või aktsiakapitalis riigi, kohaliku omavalitsusüksuse või avalik-õigusliku juriidilise isiku osalus koos või eraldi ei ületa 25 protsenti </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 3.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 8 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Aktsionäride või osanike nimekiri </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 4. </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Töölepingu alusel täistööajaga hõivatute arv ei ületanud taotlemisele eelnenud kuu viimase tööpäeva seisuga üheksat töötajat, kui taotleja taotleb toetust toiduainete töötlemise arendamiseks </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 4.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 8 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 9 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 5. </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Töölepingu alusel täistööajaga hõivatute arv suureneb investeeringujärgselt vähemalt kahe isiku võrra, kui taotleja ei ole põllumajandustootja ega taotle toetust toiduainete töötlemise arendamiseks </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 5.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 8 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 9 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 6. </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Töölepingu alusel täistööajaga hõivatute arv suureneb investeeringujärgselt vähemalt 0,5 võrra, kui taotleja on põllumajandustootja ega taotle toetust toiduainete töötlemise arendamiseks </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 6.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 8 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 9 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 7. </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Töölepingu alusel täistööajaga hõivatute arv jääb investeeringujärgselt vähemalt samaks võrreldes investeeringueelse perioodiga, kui taotleja oli investeeringueelselt põllumajandustootja ja investeeringu käigus lõpetab põllumajandussaaduste tootmise ega taotle toetust toiduainete töötlemise arendamiseks </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 7.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 8 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 9 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 8. </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Mitte varasema kui taotluse esitamisele eelnenud kuu esimese päeva seisuga on täidetud maksuseadustes sätestatud kohustused ja ei ole riikliku maksu maksuvõlga või maksuvõla tasumise ajatamise korral on maksud tasutud ajakava kohaselt </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 8.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 8 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Maksuameti tõend </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 9. </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatav investeeringuobjekt vastab investeeringujärgselt Euroopa Liidu hügieeninõuetele </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 9.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 8 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Veterinaar- ja Toiduameti hinnang </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 10. </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Puudub ettekirjutus keskkonnakaitsenõuete rikkumise eest või ettekirjutuses märgitud puudused on kõrvaldatud </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 10.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 8 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kohaliku omavalitsuse õiend </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 11. </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava ehitise asukoht on kooskõlas maakonnaplaneeringuga </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 11.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 8 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Maavalitsuse kinnitus </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 12. </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringuobjekti kohta on kolme pakkuja hinnapakkumised, juhul kui investeeringuobjekti maksumus ületab 10 000 eurot </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 12.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 8 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Hinnavõrdlustabel, kui investeeringuobjekti maksumus ületab 10 000 eurot </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"3\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 13. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"3\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatav investeeringuobjekt ostetakse kapitalirendi korras </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 13.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 8 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kapitalirendilepingu projekt </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 13.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 8 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kapitalirendi maksegraafiku projekt </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 13.3 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 8 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 9 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 14. </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Pika- ja lühiajalised kohustused </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 14.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 9 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kinnitatud majandusaasta aruande koopia või füüsilisest isikust ettevõtja bilansi koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 15. </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Omakapital </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 15.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 9 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kinnitatud majandusaasta aruande koopia või füüsilisest isikust ettevõtja bilansi koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 16. </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kasum </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 16.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 9 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kinnitatud majandusaasta aruande koopia või füüsilisest isikust ettevõtja kasumiaruande koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 17. </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Tulude ja kulude vahe </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 17.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 9 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Tulude ja kulude koond füüsilisest isikust ettevõtja puhul, kes vastavalt «Raamatupidamise seadusele» peab kassapõhist raamatupidamisarvestust </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 18. </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Pikaajalised kohustused </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 18.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 9 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Pikaajaliste kohustuste maksegraafiku koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 19. </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Ehitiste, masinate, seadmete, tööriistade, sisseseade ja muu inventari soetusmaksumus </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 19.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 9 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Ehitiste, masinate, seadmete, tööriistade, sisseseade ja muu inventari loetelu </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"4\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 20. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"4\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatav investeeringuobjekt </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 20.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 8 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parimale hinnapakkumisele vastava pakkumiskutse koopia koos pakkumise tehniliste tingimuste loeteluga </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 20.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 8 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 20.3 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 8 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 9 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 20.4 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 8 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Hinnavõrdlustabel, kui investeeringuobjekti maksumus ületab 10 000 eurot </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 21. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatav investeering vastab tegevusalale, mille arendamiseks investeeringutoetust taotletakse </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 21.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 8 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 21.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 8 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 9 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 22. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringuobjekti tehnilised tingimused </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 22.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 8 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parimale hinnapakkumisele vastav pakkumiskutse koopia koos pakkumise tehniliste tingimuste loeteluga </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 22.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 8 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"3\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 23. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"3\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringuobjekti maksumus </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 23.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 8 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 23.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 8 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 9 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 23.3 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 8 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Hinnavõrdlustabel, kui investeeringuobjekti maksumus ületab 10 000 eurot </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 24. </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringu tegemise majandusaasta kohustused ja omakapital kokku on suurem kavandatava investeeringuobjekti maksumusest </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 24.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 9 tabel 5 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 9 tabel 11 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 25. </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringu tegemise majandusaasta kavandatavaks investeeringuks kasutatavate oma- ja laenuvahendite ning toetatava investeeringu maksumuse vahe või juhul, kui kavandatav investeering tehakse mitmel majandusaastal, siis nimetatud majandusaastate kavandatavaks investeeringuks kasutatavate oma- ja laenuvahendite ning toetatava investeeringu maksumuse vahe absoluutväärtus on suurem või võrdne taotletava toetuse suurusega </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 25.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 9 tabel 9 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 9 tabel 11 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 26. </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringu maksumusest taotletava toetuse osa vastab programmi lisa 6 kolmanda meetme punktis 11 ettenähtud nõuetele </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 26.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 8 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 9 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 27. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringuobjekti maksumusse ei ole arvestatud kulusid maa ja olemasolevate ehitiste ostmiseks ning rentimiseks, sh kasutus- ja kapitalirendi korras ostmiseks </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 27.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 8 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 27.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 8 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 9 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 28. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringuobjekti maksumusse ei ole arvestatud kulusid tolli-, sisseveo-, käibe- ja muude maksete tasumiseks, mida hüvitatakse, tasaarveldatakse ja kustutatakse ning mis ei moodusta osa Eesti üldisest maksusüsteemist </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 28.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 8 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 28.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 8 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 9 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 29. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringu maksumusse ei ole arvestatud kulusid taotleja enda või tema töötajate poolt tehtud tööde eest tasumiseks </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 29.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 8 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 29.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 8 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 9 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 30. </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringuobjekti maksumusse ei ole arvestatud kulusid kasutatud seadmete ostmiseks </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 30.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 8 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 31. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringu maksumusse ei ole arvestatud kulusid taotleja tegevuskuludeks, sh remondi- ja rendikuludeks, kütuse-, palga-, koolitus-, side- ja transpordikuludeks </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 31.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 8 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 31.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 8 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 9 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 32. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringuobjekti maksumusse ei ole arvestatud kulusid kasutus- ja kapitalirendi tasumiseks, kui rendilepingu alusel renditud vara omandiõigus ei lähe üle taotlejale </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 32.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 8 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 32.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 8 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kapitalirendilepingu projekt </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 33. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringu maksumusse ei ole arvestatud kulusid panga teenustasudeks ja tagatismakseteks </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 33.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 8 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 33.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 8 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 9 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 34. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringu maksumusse ei ole arvestatud kulusid konverteerimiskuludeks ja SAPARD-eurokonto kasutamisest tulenevate kursimuutuste kahjumite katmiseks </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 34.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 8 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 34.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 8 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 9 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 35. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringu maksumusse ei ole arvestatud kulusid avaliku sektori halduskulude, kaasa arvatud Ameti poolt tehtavate kulutuste, sealhulgas järelevalve ja kontrolli teostamise eest vastutavate ametnike töötasude, rendi-, üld- ning juhtimiskulude eest tasumiseks </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 35.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 8 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 35.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 8 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 9 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 36. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringu maksumusse ei ole arvestatud kulusid juriidilisteks konsultatsioonideks, raamatupidamisteenuste eest tasumiseks, patentide ja litsentside ostmiseks ning teostatavusuuringuteks, v.a ehitise projekteerimiseks vajalike ehitusgeoloogilisteks ja -geodeetilisteks uurimistöödeks tehtud kulutuste eest tasumiseks </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 36.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 8 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 36.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 8 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 9 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 37. </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringu maksumusse ei ole arvestatud kulusid väljastpoolt Euroopa Liidu liikmes- või kandidaatriike pärinevate tellitavate tööde, teenuste ja ostetavate kaupade eest tasumiseks </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 37.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 8 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 38. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringu maksumusse ei ole arvestatud kulusid projekti teostajatele või selles osalejatele enne projekti lõpuleviimist rahalisi laekumisi võimaldavate tööde, teenuste ja kaupade eest tasumiseks </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 38.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 8 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 38.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 8 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 9 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 39. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringu maksumusse ei ole arvestatud kulusid reklaami eest tasumiseks </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 39.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 8 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 39.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 8 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 9 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 40. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringuobjekti maksumusse ei ole arvestatud kulusid investeeringuobjekti ehitamiseks, rekonstrueerimiseks ja ostmiseks, mille kasutusotstarve on jaekaubanduslike teenuste osutamine </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 40.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 8 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 40.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 8 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 9 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"3\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 41. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"3\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringuobjekti maksumusse ei ole arvestatud enne taotluse esitamist tehtud kulusid investeeringuobjekti ehitamiseks, rekonstrueerimiseks ja ostmiseks, v.a investeeringuobjekti ehitusprojekti ettevalmistamiseks tellitud töödele ja teenustele ning projekteerimiseks vajalikele ehitusgeoloogilistele ja -geodeetilistele uurimistöödele tehtud kulutused </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 41.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 8 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 41.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 8 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Ehitiste, masinate, seadmete, tööriistade, sisseseade ja muu inventari loetelu eelnenud majandusaasta viimase päeva seisuga </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 41.3 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 8 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 9 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 42. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringuobjekti maksumusse ei ole arvestatud kulusid masinate ja seadmete lisaseadmete ostmiseks, mille olemasolu ei ole vajalik kavandatava investeeringu eesmärgi saavutamiseks </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 42.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 8 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 42.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 8 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 9 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 43. </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatud mittetoetatavate investeeringute kajastamine </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 43.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 9 tabel 9 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 9 tabel 11 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 44. </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Toetatava investeeringu maksumusse ei ole arvestatud investeeringuobjektiga seotud projekteerimistööd ja projekteerimiseks vajalikku ehitusgeoloogilist ja -geodeetilist uurimistööd ning investeeringutoetuse taotluse ja äriprojekti ning neis esitatud andmeid tõendavate dokumentide koostamiseks tellitud tööd ja teenust, mis ületab 12% investeeringuobjekti käibemaksuta maksumusest </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 44.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 8 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 9 </p> </td> </tr> </tbody></table> 1Veerus toodud lisad on Vabariigi Valitsuse 28. juuni 2001. a määruse nr 216 «Eesti Vabariigis põllumajanduse ja maaelu arendamise liitumiseelse programmi raames antava investeeringutoetuse taotlemise ja taotluse menetlemise ja toetuse maksmise kord» lisad. <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"width: 100.0%\" width=\"100%\"> <tbody><tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; width: 99.46%; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\" width=\"99%\"> <p align=\"right\"> Vabariigi Valitsuse 3. juuli 2001. a määruse nr 219 «Eesti Vabariigis põllumajanduse ja maaelu arendamise liitumiseelse programmi raames antava investeeringutoetuse taotluse hindamise kord»<br/>lisa 5<br/>(Vabariigi Valitsuse 21. jaanuari 2003. a määruse nr 19 sõnastuses) </p> </td> </tr> </tbody></table> RT I 2003 11 51 242656 2003-03-01+02:00 MAAPIIRKONNA INFRASTRUKTUURI INVESTEERINGUTOETUSE SAAMISEKS ESITATUD NÕUETELE VASTAVUSE HINDAMISEKS VÕRRELDAVAD ANDMED <table class=\"data\" style=\"width: 450.0pt\"> <tbody><tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p align=\"center\"> <b>A</b> </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p align=\"center\"> <b>B</b> </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p align=\"center\"> <b>C</b> </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p align=\"center\"> <b>D</b> </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p align=\"center\"> <b>F</b> </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\"> <p> </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p align=\"center\"> Maapiirkonna infrastruktuuri investeeringutoetuse saamiseks esitatud nõue </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\"> <p> </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p align=\"center\"> Toetuse taotlemiseks esitatud dokument¹ </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p align=\"center\"> Toetuse taotlemiseks esitatud dokument¹ </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"8\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 1. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"8\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Äriregistrikood või füüsilisest isikust ettevõtja puhul, kes ei ole äriregistrisse kantud, maksukohustuslaste registri tõendi number või isikukood </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 1.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 10 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Maksukohustuslaste registri tõendi koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 1.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 10 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kinnitatud majandusaasta aruande koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 1.3 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 10 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Maksuameti tõend </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 1.4 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 10 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Aktsionäride või osanike nimekiri </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 1.5 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 10 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Keskkonnamemorandum või selle koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 1.6 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 10 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Seadusejärgset esindusõigust mitteomava isiku puhul volitusi tõendav volikiri </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 1.7 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 10 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Pädeva isiku tõend elektrivõimsuse ja -pinge hälvete kohta </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 1.8 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 10 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 11 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 2. </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatav investeeringuobjekt asub maapiirkonas </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 2.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 10 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 11 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 3. </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Äriühingu osa- või aktsiakapitalis riigi, kohaliku omavalitsusüksuse või avalik-õigusliku juriidilise isiku osalus koos või eraldi ei ületa 25 protsenti </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 3.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 10 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Aktsionäride või osanike nimekiri </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 4. </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Mitte varasema kui taotluse esitamisele eelnenud kuu esimese päeva seisuga on täidetud maksuseadustes sätestatud kohustused ja ei ole riikliku maksu maksuvõlga või maksuvõla tasumise ajatamise korral on maksud tasutud ajakava kohaselt </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 4.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 10 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Maksuameti tõend </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 5. </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Nõusolek kavandatava investeeringu tegemiseks maapiirkonnas </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 5.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 10 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kohaliku omavalitsuse nõusolek </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 6. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Elektrivõimsus ja -pinge hälbed ning madalpingeliini pikkus vastavad programmi lisa 6 neljanda meetme punktis 5.1 ettenähtud nõuetele </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 6.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 10 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 6.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 10 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Pädeva isiku tõend elektrivõimsuse ja -pinge hälvete kohta </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 7. </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringuobjekti kohta on kolme pakkuja hinnapakkumised, juhul kui investeeringuobjekti maksumus ületab 10 000 eurot </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 7.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 10 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Hinnavõrdlustabel, kui investeeringuobjekti maksumus ületab 10 000 eurot </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"3\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 8. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"3\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatav investeeringuobjekt ostetakse kapitalirendi korras </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 8.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 10 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kapitalirendilepingu projekt </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 8.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 10 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kapitalirendi maksegraafiku projekt </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 8.3 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 10 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 11 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 9. </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Pika- ja lühiajalised kohustused </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 9.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 11 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kinnitatud majandusaasta aruande koopia või füüsilisest isikust ettevõtja bilansi koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 10. </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Omakapital </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 10.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 11 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kinnitatud majandusaasta aruande koopia või füüsilisest isikust ettevõtja bilansi koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 11. </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kasum </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 11.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 11 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kinnitatud majandusaasta aruande koopia või füüsilisest isikust ettevõtja kasumiaruande koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 12. </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Tulude ja kulude vahe </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 12.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 11 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Tulude ja kulude koond füüsilisest isikust ettevõtja puhul, kes vastavalt «Raamatupidamise seadusele» peab kassapõhist raamatupidamisarvestust </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 13. </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Pikaajalised kohustused </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 13.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 11 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Pikaajaliste kohustuste maksegraafiku koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 14. </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Ehitiste, masinate, seadmete, tööriistade, sisseseade ja muu inventari soetusmaksumus </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 14.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 11 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Ehitiste, masinate, seadmete, tööriistade, sisseseade ja muu inventari loetelu </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"4\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 15. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"4\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatav investeeringuobjekt </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 15.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 10 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parimale hinnapakkumisele vastava pakkumiskutse koopia koos pakkumise tehniliste tingimuste loeteluga </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 15.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 10 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 15.3 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 10 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 11 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 15.4 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 10 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Hinnavõrdlustabel, kui investeeringuobjekti maksumus ületab 10 000 eurot </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 16. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatav investeering vastab tegevusalale, mille arendamiseks investeeringutoetust taotletakse </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 16.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 10 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 16.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 10 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 11 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 17. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringuobjekti tehnilised tingimused </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 17.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 10 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parimale hinnapakkumisele vastava pakkumiskutse koopia koos pakkumise tehniliste tingimuste loeteluga </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 17.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 10 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"3\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 18. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"3\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringuobjekti maksumus </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 18.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 10 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 18.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 10 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 11 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 18.3 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 10 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Hinnavõrdlustabel, kui investeeringuobjekti maksumus ületab 10 000 eurot </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 19. </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringu tegemise majandusaasta kohustused ja omakapital kokku on suurem kavandatava investeeringuobjekti maksumusest </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 19.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 11 tabel 5 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 11 tabel 11 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 20. </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringu tegemise majandusaasta kavandatavaks investeeringuks kasutatavate oma- ja laenuvahendite ning toetatava investeeringu maksumuse vahe või juhul, kui kavandatav investeering tehakse mitmel majandusaastal, siis nimetatud majandusaastate kavandatavaks investeeringuks kasutatavate oma- ja laenuvahendite ning toetatava investeeringu maksumuse vahe absoluutväärtus on suurem või võrdne taotletava toetuse suurusega </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 20.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 11 tabel 9 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 11 tabel 11 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 21. </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringu maksumusest taotletava toetuse osa vastab programmi lisa 6 neljanda meetme punktis 11 ettenähtud nõuetele </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 21.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 10 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 11 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 22. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringuobjekti maksumusse ei ole arvestatud kulusid maa ja olemasolevate ehitiste ostmiseks ning rentimiseks, sh kasutus- ja kapitalirendi korras ostmiseks </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 22.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 10 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 22.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 10 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 11 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 23. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringuobjekti maksumusse ei ole arvestatud kulusid tolli-, sisseveo-, käibe- ja muude maksete tasumiseks, mida hüvitatakse, kompenseeritakse, tasaarveldatakse ja kustutatakse ning mis ei moodusta osa Eesti üldisest maksusüsteemist </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 23.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 10 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 23.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 10 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 11 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 24. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringu maksumusse ei ole arvestatud kulusid taotleja enda või tema töötajate poolt tehtud tööde eest tasumiseks </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 24.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 10 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 24.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 10 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 11 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 25. </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringuobjekti maksumusse ei ole arvestatud kulusid kasutatud seadmete ostmiseks </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 25.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 10 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 26. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringu maksumusse ei ole arvestatud kulusid taotleja tegevuskuludeks, sh remondi- ja rendikuludeks, kütuse-, palga-, koolitus-, side- ja remondikuludeks </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 26.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 10 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 26.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 10 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 11 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 27. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringuobjekti maksumusse ei ole arvestatud kulusid kasutus- ja kapitalirendi tasumiseks, kui rendilepingu alusel renditud vara omandiõigus ei lähe üle taotlejale </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 27.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 10 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 27.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 10 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kapitalirendilepingu projekt </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 28. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringu maksumusse ei ole arvestatud kulusid panga teenustasudeks ja tagatismakseteks </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 28.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 10 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 28.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 10 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 11 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"3\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 29. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"3\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringu maksumusse ei ole arvestatud kulusid konverteerimiskuludeks ja SAPARD-eurokonto kasutamisest tulenevate kursimuutuste kahjumite katmiseks </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 29.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 10 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 29.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 10 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 11 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 29.3 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 10 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 11 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 30. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringu maksumusse ei ole arvestatud kulusid avaliku sektori halduskulude, kaasa arvatud Ameti poolt tehtavate kulutuste, sh järelevalve ja kontrolli teostamise eest vastutavate ametnike töötasude, rendi-, üld- ning juhtimiskulude eest tasumiseks </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 30.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 10 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 30.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 10 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 11 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 31. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringu maksumusse ei ole arvestatud kulusid juriidilisteks konsultatsioonideks, raamatupidamisteenuste eest tasumiseks, patentide ja litsentside ostmiseks ning teostatavusuuringuteks, v.a ehitise projekteerimiseks vajalike ehitusgeoloogilisteks ja -geodeetilisteks uurimistöödeks tehtud kulutuste eest tasumiseks </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 31.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 10 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 31.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 10 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 11 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 32. </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringu maksumusse ei ole arvestatud kulusid väljastpoolt Euroopa Liidu liikmes- või kandidaatriike pärinevate tellitavate tööde, teenuste ja ostetavate kaupade eest tasumiseks </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 32.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 10 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 33. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringu maksumusse ei ole arvestatud kulusid projekti teostajatele või selles osalejatele enne projekti lõpuleviimist rahalisi laekumisi võimaldavate tööde, teenuste ja kaupade eest tasumiseks </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 33.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 10 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 33.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 10 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 11 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 34. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringu maksumusse ei ole arvestatud kulusid reklaami eest tasumiseks </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 34.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 10 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 34.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 10 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 11 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 35. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringuobjekti maksumusse ei ole arvestatud kulusid investeeringuobjekti ehitamiseks, rekonstrueerimiseks ja ostmiseks, mille kasutusotstarve on jaekaubanduslike teenuste osutamine </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 35.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 10 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 35.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 10 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 11 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"3\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 36. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"3\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringuobjekti maksumusse ei ole arvestatud enne taotluse esitamist tehtud kulusid investeeringuobjekti ehitamiseks, rekonstrueerimiseks ja ostmiseks, v.a investeeringuobjekti ehitusprojekti ettevalmistamiseks tellitud töödele ja teenustele ning projekteerimiseks vajalikele ehitusgeoloogilistele ja -geodeetilistele uurimistöödele tehtud kulutused </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 36.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 10 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 36.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 10 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Ehitiste, masinate, seadmete, tööriistade, sisseseade ja muu inventari loetelu eelnenud majandusaasta viimase päeva seisuga </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 36.3 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 10 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 11 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 37. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatava investeeringuobjekti maksumusse ei ole arvestatud kulusid masinate ja seadmete lisaseadmete ostmiseks, mille olemasolu ei ole vajalik kavandatava investeeringu eesmärgi saavutamiseks </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 37.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 10 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Valitud parima hinnapakkumise koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 37.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 10 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 11 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 38. </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatud mittetoetatavate investeeringute kajastamine </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 38.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 11 tabel 9 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 11 tabel 11 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 39. </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Toetatava investeeringu maksumusse ei ole arvestatud investeeringuobjektiga seotud projekteerimistööd ja projekteerimiseks vajalikku ehitusgeoloogilist ja -geodeetilist uurimistööd ning investeeringutoetuse taotluse ja äriprojekti ning neis esitatud andmeid tõendavate dokumentide koostamiseks tellitud tööd ja teenust, mis ületab 12% investeeringuobjekti käibemaksuta maksumusest </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 39.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 10 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 11 </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 40. </p> </td> <td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatav investeeringuobjekt on vajalik teistele maapiirkonnas elavatele ja asuvatele isikutele ning taotleja ei ole kavandatavas elektrivarustusvõrgus viimane tarbija, kui taotletakse toetust kõrgendatud määra ulatuses programmi lisa 6 neljanda meetme punktis 3.1 nimetatud tegevustele </p> <p> </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 40.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 10 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kohaliku omavalitsuse kinnitus </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 40.2 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 10 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Pädeva isiku poolt koostatud eellahenduse koopia </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 41. </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatav investeeringuobjekt on vajalik teistele maapiirkonnas elavatele ja asuvatele isikutele, kui taotletakse toetust kõrgendatud määra ulatuses programmi lisa 6 neljanda meetme punktis 3.2 nimetatud tegevustele </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 41.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 10 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kohaliku omavalitsuse kinnitus </p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 42. </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kavandatav investeeringuobjekt on vajalik teistele maapiirkonnas elavatele ja asuvatele isikutele, kui taotletakse toetust kõrgendatud määra ulatuses programmi lisa 6 neljanda meetme punktis 3.4 nimetatud tegevustele </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> 42.1 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Lisa 10 </p> </td> <td style=\"padding-right: .75pt; padding-left: .75pt; padding-bottom: .75pt; padding-top: .75pt\" valign=\"top\"> <p> Kohaliku omavalitsusega sõlmitud eelkokkuleppe koopia </p> </td> </tr> </tbody></table> RT I 2003 39 270 578575 2003-05-12 1Veerus toodud lisad on Vabariigi Valitsuse 28. juuni 2001. a määruse nr 216 «Eesti Vabariigis põllumajanduse ja maaelu arendamise liitumiseelse programmi raames antava investeeringutoetuse taotlemise, taotluse menetlemise ja toetuse maksmise kord» lisad. Taotleja, tema eelnenud majandustegevuse, kavandatava investeeringu ja sellele järgneva majandustegevuse vastavus maapiirkonna infrastruktuuri investeeringutoetuse saamiseks esitatud nõuetele tehakse kindlaks ja hindamisleht koostatakse vastavalt §-le 6. PÕLLUMAJANDUSTOOTMISE INVESTEERINGUTOETUSE SAAMISEKS ESITATUD NÕUETELE VASTAVUSE HINDAMISEKS VÕRRELDAVAD ANDMED 1Veerus toodud lisad on Vabariigi Valitsuse 28. juuni 2001. a määruse nr 216 «Eesti Vabariigis põllumajanduse ja maaelu arendamise liitumiseelse programmi raames antava investeeringutoetuse taotlemise, taotluse menetlemise ja toetuse maksmise kord» (RT I 2001, 60, 363; 2002, 6, 25) lisad. PÕLLUMAJANDUS- JA KALANDUSTOODETE TOOTMISE JA TURUSTAMISE PARANDAMISE INVESTEERINGUTOETUSE SAAMISEKS ESITATUD NÕUETELE VASTAVUSE HINDAMISEKS VÕRRELDAVAD ANDMED 1Veerus toodud lisad on Vabariigi Valitsuse 28. juuni 2001. a määruse nr 216 «Eesti Vabariigis põllumajanduse ja maaelu arendamise liitumiseelse programmi raames antava investeeringutoetuse taotlemise, taotluse menetlemise ja toetuse maksmise kord» lisad. Vabariigi Valitsuse 3. juuli 2001. a määruse nr 219 «Eesti Vabariigis põllumajanduse ja maaelu arendamise liitumiseelse programmi raames antava investeeringutoetuse taotluse hindamise kord» lisa 3 PÕLLUMAJANDUS- JA KALANDUSTOODETE TOOTMISE JA TURUSTAMISE PARANDAMISE INVESTEERINGUTOETUSE PAREMUSJÄRJESTUSE MÄÄRAMISEKS VÕRRELDAVAD ANDMED 1Vabariigi Valitsuse 28. juuni 2001. a määruse nr 216 «Eesti Vabariigi põllumajanduse ja maaelu arendamise liitumiseelse programmi raames antava investeeringutoetuse taotlemise, taotluse menetlemise ja toetuse maksmise kord» lisa. MAAPIIRKONNAS ALTERNATIIVSE MAJANDUSTEGEVUSE ARENDAMISE JA MITMEKESISTAMISE INVESTEERINGUTOETUSE SAAMISEKS ESITATUD NÕUETELE VASTAVUSE HINDAMISEKS VÕRRELDAVAD ANDMED 1Veerus toodud lisad on Vabariigi Valitsuse 28. juuni 2001. a määruse nr 216 «Eesti Vabariigis põllumajanduse ja maaelu arendamise liitumiseelse programmi raames antava investeeringutoetuse taotlemise ja taotluse menetlemise ja toetuse maksmise kord» lisad. MAAPIIRKONNA INFRASTRUKTUURI INVESTEERINGUTOETUSE SAAMISEKS ESITATUD NÕUETELE VASTAVUSE HINDAMISEKS VÕRRELDAVAD ANDMED 1Veerus toodud lisad on Vabariigi Valitsuse 28. juuni 2001. a määruse nr 216 «Eesti Vabariigis põllumajanduse ja maaelu arendamise liitumiseelse programmi raames antava investeeringutoetuse taotlemise, taotluse menetlemise ja toetuse maksmise kord» lisad.",
      "rdfs:label": {
        "@value": "Reg_160872_Par_17 (redaktsioon 160872)",
